  "spec": [
    "C2.5",
    "C8.2"
  ],
  "note": "A reference-typed ARGUMENT is dereferenced before the given runs (C2.5): Account.Open's `customer.status == \"active\"` reads the status of the referenced Customer, not the bare id. Opening for an active customer lands; opening for a suspended one is GivenNotMet, and no account exists for it.",
